# Exercise 3.9 - DBaaS vs DIY Comparison Analysis

This directory would contain example manifests for:

## Option 1: Google Cloud SQL (DBaaS)
- Cloud SQL Proxy deployment
- Secret for credentials
- Service example

## Option 2: PostgreSQL DIY (Self-hosted)
- StatefulSet for PostgreSQL
- PersistentVolumeClaim
- ConfigMap for initialization
- Service

See README.md for detailed comparison and recommendations.
